e  and its spin-offs while a battle royale  title called final fantasy vii the first  soldier has also recently launched  i know it's only monday but we're  already off to a wild start and if you  want to stay up to date on all of the  news and all the latest updates around  sony's acquisition then make sure you  stop by gamespot.com alright leave a  like subscribe and we'll see you  tomorrow for your next gamespot news  update  [Music]  you
 

